  "_stability_note": "stable = the value should not change between answers, so a divergence is a contradiction (team size, tenure). variable = the value moves over time by design, so 'CSAT was 78, then 92' is a before/after, NOT a lie. Only stable keys can raise a contradiction. This single distinction is what stops the consistency engine from punishing every improvement a candidate describes."
